{"4412590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neofold", "steam_appid": 4412590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4932450, 4979860, 4702890, 4702880, 4702870], "detailed_description": "The infinite creature-collector where each pet is uniquely yours, generated live by your GPU. Hatch endless weirdos, adopt the ones you love, and grow a living sanctuary of species that exist only on your desktop.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412590/extras/728fb41960427cd9ea986a3893847b04.webp?t=1787051336\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412590/extras/728fb41960427cd9ea986a3893847b04.poster.avif?t=1787051336\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=120 /></picture></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>✨ Infinite unique creatures:</strong> Each pet is uniquely yours, generated in real-time by your GPU! No suitable graphics card? A collection of 1500+ pre-generated pets is ready to go.<br></li><li><strong>🥚 Idler at your pace:</strong> Watch your pets roam and interact freely while you wait for your eggs to hatch, or speed it up by tapping eggs as they shake.<br></li><li><strong>🌿 Meaningful choices:</strong> Each batch contains five newborns, but you can only keep one! Pick your absolute favorite, give it a name, and release the rest into the wild.<br></li><li><strong>🌷 Cozy wallpaper:</strong> Your sanctuary (optionally) becomes your desktop's animated wallpaper, featuring a real-time day/night cycle, soothing ambient sounds, and a built-in MP3 player.<br></li><li><strong>🌍 Huge open world:</strong> Expand your horizons by collecting location DLCs to seamlessly expand the map and unlock new vistas for your weirdos to inhabit.<br></li><li><strong>🔒 100% offline, 100% yours:</strong> No internet connection, no account, no subscriptions. Everything is generated on your machine and stays there. Do with the creature sprites as you please, they're yours!<br></li><li><strong>⚙️ Highly customizable:</strong> Tweak your creatures, the animations, UI, audio, and even the core world and engine settings. This is your sanctuary.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412590/extras/a78913d64ff89bd51bc286f5d31c6663.webp?t=1787051336\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412590/extras/a78913d64ff89bd51bc286f5d31c6663.poster.avif?t=1787051336\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=120 /></picture></span><br><br><strong>Developer's note:</strong> <i>Weird creatures have fascinated me for as long as I remember. Neofold is my love letter to creature-collectors such as Pokémon and Palworld, bringing an infinity of real-time generated weirdos right to your desktop. Every hatch is a surprise that's yours alone, giving you something novel to look forward to each day. After months of development, I've yet to go a day without being amazed by a generation. Hope you enjoy it as much as I do!</i><br><br>Ready to grow your sanctuary of weirdos?<br><strong>100% offline. Infinite creatures. Uniquely yours.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412590/extras/bf842f350d36871935f590f1b93589fc.webp?t=1787051336\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412590/extras/bf842f350d36871935f590f1b93589fc.poster.avif?t=1787051336\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=120 /></picture></span>", "about_the_game": "The infinite creature-collector where each pet is uniquely yours, generated live by your GPU. Hatch endless weirdos, adopt the ones you love, and grow a living sanctuary of species that exist only on your desktop.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412590/extras/728fb41960427cd9ea986a3893847b04.webp?t=1787051336\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412590/extras/728fb41960427cd9ea986a3893847b04.poster.avif?t=1787051336\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=120 /></picture></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>✨ Infinite unique creatures:</strong> Each pet is uniquely yours, generated in real-time by your GPU! No suitable graphics card? A collection of 1500+ pre-generated pets is ready to go.<br></li><li><strong>🥚 Idler at your pace:</strong> Watch your pets roam and interact freely while you wait for your eggs to hatch, or speed it up by tapping eggs as they shake.<br></li><li><strong>🌿 Meaningful choices:</strong> Each batch contains five newborns, but you can only keep one! Pick your absolute favorite, give it a name, and release the rest into the wild.<br></li><li><strong>🌷 Cozy wallpaper:</strong> Your sanctuary (optionally) becomes your desktop's animated wallpaper, featuring a real-time day/night cycle, soothing ambient sounds, and a built-in MP3 player.<br></li><li><strong>🌍 Huge open world:</strong> Expand your horizons by collecting location DLCs to seamlessly expand the map and unlock new vistas for your weirdos to inhabit.<br></li><li><strong>🔒 100% offline, 100% yours:</strong> No internet connection, no account, no subscriptions. Everything is generated on your machine and stays there. Do with the creature sprites as you please, they're yours!<br></li><li><strong>⚙️ Highly customizable:</strong> Tweak your creatures, the animations, UI, audio, and even the core world and engine settings. This is your sanctuary.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412590/extras/a78913d64ff89bd51bc286f5d31c6663.webp?t=1787051336\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412590/extras/a78913d64ff89bd51bc286f5d31c6663.poster.avif?t=1787051336\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=120 /></picture></span><br><br><strong>Developer's note:</strong> <i>Weird creatures have fascinated me for as long as I remember. Neofold is my love letter to creature-collectors such as Pokémon and Palworld, bringing an infinity of real-time generated weirdos right to your desktop. Every hatch is a surprise that's yours alone, giving you something novel to look forward to each day. After months of development, I've yet to go a day without being amazed by a generation. Hope you enjoy it as much as I do!</i><br><br>Ready to grow your sanctuary of weirdos?<br><strong>100% offline. Infinite creatures. Uniquely yours.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412590/extras/bf842f350d36871935f590f1b93589fc.webp?t=1787051336\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412590/extras/bf842f350d36871935f590f1b93589fc.poster.avif?t=1787051336\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=120 /></picture></span>", "short_description": "The infinite creature-collector where each pet is uniquely yours, generated live by your GPU. Hatch endless weirdos, adopt the ones you love, and grow a living sanctuary of species that exist only on your desktop.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Bulgarian<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Indonesian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Romanian<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<str